---
// EarlifyValidation.astro - Disciplina de Validación Clínica y Tecnológica
---

<section id="evidencia-clinica" class="earlify-validation section-padding" aria-labelledby="validation-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
        <span>EVIDENCIA Y RIGOR CIENTÍFICO</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="validation-title" class="section-title">
        Disciplina de <span class="gradient-text">Validación Clínica y Tecnológica</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Frente a propuestas impulsadas por expectativas artificiales sin encaje asistencial, Earlify Health nace del dolor clínico empírico y se rige por la disciplina rigurosa de validación institucional, técnica, regulatoria y científica.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="validation-grid">
      <!-- Activo 1: startTIC -->
      <article class="validation-card glass-card card-highlight-cyan">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-cyan">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="status-pill status-verified">Validación IoT &amp; Hardware</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="metric-title">startTIC · Incubadora de Alta Tecnología</span>
          <span class="metric-label">Zona Franca de Vigo · Gradiant · FEDER · INCYDE</span>
          <p class="metric-desc">
            Validación de Hardware &amp; IoT con Centro Tecnológico GRADIANT, Consorcio de la Zona Franca de Vigo, cofinanciado al 60% por el Fondo Europeo FEDER a través de la Fundación INCYDE en el VgoTIC Global HUB.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Activo 2: SUS 90/100 -->
      <article class="validation-card glass-card card-highlight-cyan">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-emerald">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="status-pill status-verified">Percentil 96 · SGORL</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="metric-number-row">
            <span class="metric-number">90 / 100</span>
            <span class="metric-unit">SUS</span>
          </div>
          <span class="metric-label">Usabilidad Clínica en System Usability Scale</span>
          <p class="metric-desc">
            Percentil 96 en la System Usability Scale, presentado en el 52.º Congreso de la Sociedad Gallega de Otorrinolaringología (SGORL) como evidencia de aceptación en consulta.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Activo 3: ITEMAS-ISCIII 2024 -->
      <article class="validation-card glass-card">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-purple">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="status-pill status-official">Sello Oficial SNS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="metric-title">Sello ITEMAS-ISCIII 2024</span>
          <span class="metric-label">Instituto de Salud Carlos III</span>
          <p class="metric-desc">
            Plataforma de Dinamización e Innovación de Capacidades Industriales del SNS (Instituto de Salud Carlos III) para aceleración y transferencia tecnológica sanitaria.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Activo 4: Zenodo DOI (TRL 5) -->
      <article class="validation-card glass-card">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-cyan">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="status-pill status-published">DOI Persistente · TRL 5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="metric-title">Zenodo DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.16788385</span>
          <span class="metric-label">Prueba de Concepto Publicada (TRL 5)</span>
          <p class="metric-desc">
            PoC de VALERIA+ publicada y archivada formalmente con identificador persistente internacional (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.16788385), certificando madurez tecnológica TRL 5.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Activo 5: Tesis Doctoral USC -->
      <article class="validation-card glass-card">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-purple">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"></path><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="status-pill status-academic">Investigación Doctoral USC</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="metric-title">Tesis Doctoral (Dr. Betances · USC)</span>
          <span class="metric-label">ACOPROS (2023–2027)</span>
          <p class="metric-desc">
            Ensayo clínico con 20 pacientes pediátricos con implante coclear / audífono en colaboración con la Asociación de Familias de Personas Sordas de A Coruña (ACOPROS).
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Activo 6: FONDOCYT -->
      <article class="validation-card glass-card">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <div class="card-icon-wrap icon-amber">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="status-pill status-scientific">Cooperación Científica</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <span class="metric-title">FONDOCYT 2024-3-4A2-0922</span>
          <span class="metric-label">MESCYT / UFHEC · Quisqueya Habla</span>
          <p class="metric-desc">
            Subvención pública de I+D para la validación cultural del algoritmo y cribado del neurodesarrollo en población infantil dominicana (es-DO) en CIADIF y Padre Cavalotto.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .earlify-validation {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(70px, 10vw, 115px) 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark, #07090e);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    color: #34d399;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34d399 0%, #00f2fe 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .validation-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .validation-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .validation-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .card-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-icon-wrap {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .icon-cyan { background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12); color: #00f2fe; }
  .icon-emerald { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); color: #34d399; }
  .icon-purple { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; }
  .icon-amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #fbbf24; }

  .status-pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .status-verified { background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12); color: #00f2fe; }
  .status-official { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; }
  .status-published { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); color: #34d399; }
  .status-academic { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #e9d5ff; }
  .status-scientific { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #fbbf24; }

  .metric-number-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .metric-number {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .metric-unit {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #00f2fe;
  }

  .metric-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .metric-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .metric-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .validation-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .validation-grid {
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .validation-grid::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .validation-card {
      min-width: 280px;
      max-width: 280px;
      scroll-snap-align: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
